WEBVTT

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.660
"This is a work of fiction. The characters,
organizations, and names herein are fictitious,
and bear no relation to existing entities."

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.250
He went that way!

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.200
Cut him off! Surround him!

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.290
Kill his ass!

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.410
Makoto Majima! Where are you?!

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:25.870
You traitor!

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:29.370
This is revenge for King!
We'll beat <i>you </i>to death, too!

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.790
Red Angels!

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.410
Get 'em!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.160
You murderers!

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.330
Ikebukuro belongs to us!

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.950
It's like I'm having a bad dream.

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:50.160
Until yesterday, I was friends with the G-Boys,

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.950
and now tonight, they're chasing
me all around Ikebukuro.

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:58.080
Why did things turn out like this?!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:11.250
"Ikebukuro West Gate Park"

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:34.950
Are you sayin' this street belongs to you guys?!

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:36.290
That's right!

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:38.290
You punks are too uppity!

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.290
What?!

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:42.080
<i>You </i>guys are the bossy ones!

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:46.160
Cut it out! If you quarrel over it here,
they police will come!

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.200
Come on, you guys back off, too.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.000
But, Makoto-san!

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.620
We're the ones who bailed you out, y'know!

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.040
What the hell'd you say?!

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.870
--It's the truth!
--We told you to stop!

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:57.790
Take this!

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.250
Bastard!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.450
There've been more quarrels
lately between the G-Boys

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:09.790
and the Red Angels,
who've been growing in influence.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.410
It seems the Red Angels
have been holding back less

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:16.040
ever since they subdued
the G-Boys' internal conflict.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:20.000
The boundary between the
groups' turfs is Sunshine Street.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.700
This boils down to a border dispute.

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.660
So, what led to it?

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:33.200
Our members were making a fuss at a café
where the G-Boys have been hanging out.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:37.330
And then some G-Boys
got all attitudinal about it!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.000
And so, you look like that.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.200
It's no laughing matter, Kyouichi!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:47.410
Try being me, the guy who
has to mediate things every time.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.160
My mom gets pissed when I can't mind the shop.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:54.830
My family's been told
not to go starting anything.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.910
However, we'll fight back if attacked.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:01.160
Otherwise, we can't protect each other.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:06.040
I don't want to cause trouble
for your mom, though.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:08.910
So, okay, I'll try talking to King.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.870
All right.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:13.500
Tomorrow night it is.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.660
Yeah, it's basically territorial negotiations.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:21.330
Whose turf ends where,
and where's the neutral zone.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:23.870
Both sides will concede what they'll concede.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.790
There's no reason for a dispute
in a town this big.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:31.200
That's fine. We'll work this out somehow.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.160
He agrees. Tomorrow night at 7:00.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:37.200
At a suite at the Sunshine Hotel.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.660
You heard him.

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:41.370
I'll go talk this out tomorrow.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:43.250
Until then, no fighting.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.450
We can't trust them!

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.290
What if they launch a sneak attack?!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.120
He's right!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.200
Those guys play dirty!

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:53.330
This guy sure is spirited.

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:57.040
Shigeyuki Utsumi. He's our number 3.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:01.120
I don't fully trust them either, to be honest.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:04.040
Although I do think of King as a friend.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:09.290
Wouldn't you say there are lot
of hotheads in the G-Boys?

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:11.330
I'll be there for the talks.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:15.750
You won't be in any danger. I promise.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.830
Guys, let's trust Makoto-san on this!

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.790
Okay then, tomorrow night at Sunshine.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:24.660
Right.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.660
I hope it goes well!

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.040
Hey, Mitsuki.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.290
How's your leg?

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:31.450
It's all better now.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:34.330
Uh, Majima-san.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.620
Um...

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:42.660
Uh, no. Nevermind.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:14.750
"Majima Produce"

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.330
"Majima Produce"

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.330
Makoto! Makoto!

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:17.870
"Yank Step"

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:21.580
They're talking about
Kyouichi-kun's group on the news!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.450
Somebody got killed!

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:28.080
The victim is Kazumasa Watanabe-san, age 19.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:31.080
He was found late last night
in an East Ikebukuro park,

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.450
"Deceased: Kazumasa Watanabe-san (19)"

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.450
stabbed through the heart with a knife.

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:39.200
At this time, there are no witnesses,
and the police are asking the public to...

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:52.950
Let me through!

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:00.580
Kazu was a good guy.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:04.910
When I danced, he was always
at the very front, watching.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.910
Kyouichi...

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:10.290
Is this how the G-Boys do things?

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:14.580
This is why I said not to trust the G-Boys!

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:17.700
If we let this go, we'll lose more of our guys!

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:20.330
Are you going to keep quiet
and leave this to the cops, Kyouichi?!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.370
No!

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.120
We fight back if attacked.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:29.750
We'll make them pay for Kazu with blood!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:30.580
Yeah!

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:31.910
It's vengeance for Kazu!

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:33.700
We'll slaughter them!

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:37.250
Wait! There's nothing
that says the G-Boys did it!

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.330
Oh, no?

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:40.750
Then what's up with this picture?!

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:46.540
You don't get to stand in the middle anymore.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:48.870
You're with us, or against us!

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.700
Please, go.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.250
It's not safe for you to be here now.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:03.370
"Ikebukuro Ekimae Park"

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:03.370
It took time to check into the inside story.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.080
"Ikebukuro Ekimae Park"

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.080
There are a lot of people involved, you know.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.290
I sent my guards away.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.200
We can talk about anything here.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:14.250
So, what really happened?

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:17.080
I'm not the one who gave the order.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:23.040
But there's a chance some reckless
G-Boy did it and is keeping quiet.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:26.410
If the perp <i>is </i>a G-Boy, what'll you do?

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:28.370
That's a tough question.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:33.580
But I'd probably hand them over
to the police and hire a good lawyer.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:38.540
Not that I'm sure that would
calm the other side's anger.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:41.700
And if it doesn't?

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.830
I guess we'd have to fight.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.410
Otherwise, they'd mess us up.

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:50.120
It started snowing.

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:54.200
Whenever a conflict happens in this town,

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:57.950
there's always someone behind the scenes
stirring up hatred or mutual distrust.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:01.200
Someone who'll benefit from that conflict.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:05.750
The guy who was killed, Watanabe.
He was trying to tell me something.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:08.830
Maybe someone's behind the scenes again...

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:16.040
Mitsuki.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:19.000
What, do you have some message from Isogai?

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.160
Stop!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.500
Takashi!

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:54.830
Hey! Open your eyes!

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:02.830
He failed to get one of them.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.620
Drop the gun!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.000
Wait! I'm not the one who--

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.290
Don't move!

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.620
Please respond.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:15.290
Please respond. In front of
the Ekimae Park bike parking...

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:16.950
Hey! Get back here!

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:22.160
Hey, you! Stop!

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.370
Stop this instant!

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.250
Don't let him get away.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:30.000
But make it so you can't tell we did it.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:35.000
"Episode 11"

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:38.000
"Majima Produce"

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.330
Makoto!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.870
Listen, Takashi was...!

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:46.040
Mako-bro!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.200
What's this all about?!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.330
The internet's been going nuts!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.870
They're saying Ikebukuro's King
was shot by Makoto Majima!

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:57.950
And that Takashi-san is in the hospital.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:01.910
So, what happened?! It had better not be true!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:04.580
I was set up!

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:06.580
Makoto.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.370
Take this and go.

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:10.330
Mom...

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.080
We'll deal with whatever happens next.

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:16.000
You go and find whoever shot Takashi-kun!

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:20.790
Makoto! Move it!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.790
Mako-bro!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.410
--Mom!
--Mom!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.200
--Mom! Speak to me, Mom!
--Was there an accident?

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.540
Call 911!

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.370
Somebody go get a cop from the police box!

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:39.450
Mom! Please be okay, Mom!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:40.660
Mom!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.160
Mako-bro, run for it!

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:46.500
Mom...

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.200
Mom! Mom!

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.830
Somebody's out to get you!

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:55.500
Leave her to me, and get going already!

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:56.910
Guo...

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:02.660
Out the back, hurry!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.910
Okay.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.370
Look after her!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.290
Shit!

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:20.830
G-Boys...

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:22.910
--There he is!
--Makoto Majima!

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:25.450
You shot King!

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:27.660
Wait! I'm not the one who...!

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:29.000
Kill him!

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:33.330
Hey, get back here!

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:36.000
Who set me up?

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.660
Who did this?!

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:38.910
Who?

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.290
Who?! Who?!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.910
Don't get him get away!

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.790
Where'd he go?!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:54.870
"Isogai"

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.500
--There he is!
--Over there!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:12:59.910
Hold it!

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.540
Isogai? It's me!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.660
Makoto-san! I saw the image!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.540
What the hell's going on?!

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:19.370
The one who shot Takashi was your guy, Mitsuki!

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:20.290
Huh?!

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:24.000
Was it Kyouichi's order,
or did you have him do it?!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:24.830
Well?!

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:26.950
Of course not!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:31.410
But maybe someone in the Red Angels did...

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.750
Makoto-san, where are you right now?

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.200
Can we meet up?

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.580
Never mind that, find Mitsuki!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.790
Something was wrong with him.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.870
I think someone gave him drugs!

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:43.250
There he is!

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:45.500
Kill him!

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.790
I'm gonna hide out somewhere!

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:49.540
I'll contact you later!

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:51.950
Makoto-san! Makoto-san!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:54.910
"Location information acquisition"

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.080
"Ikebukuro"

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:04.620
Okay, let's go kick some G-Boy ass!

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:06.870
You cool with that, Kyouichi?!

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:14.620
Of course. The ones who killed Kazu
will suffer twice as much as he did.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:18.830
There won't be any G-Boys
left here in Ikebukuro!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:21.040
They'll pay in blood!

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:24.790
It's war!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.410
Let's get 'em!

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:35.450
Kill his ass!

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:37.410
Makoto Majima! Where are you?!

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:39.370
You traitor!

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:41.040
Red Angels!

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.120
Get 'em!

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.790
You murderers!

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:47.160
Ikebukuro belongs to us!

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.290
Die!

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:55.540
Drop dead!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.200
I never liked you guys anyway!

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.120
"Reiichirou Yokoyama"

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.450
"Swipe to turn off phone."

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.040
Yes?

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:33.540
Hello, Big Rei.

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.830
Makoto? Where are you?!

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.200
I'm not the one who shot Takashi.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:41.290
It was a Red Angel named Mitsuki Fujimoto.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.250
In any case, turn yourself in.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.500
Tell me your location, and we'll come get you.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.750
I can't afford to do that.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.830
I've got to figure out who framed me,
who's behind the scenes!

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.410
"Begin pinpointing"

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.410
I've got to figure out who framed me,
who's behind the scenes!

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.330
"East Ikebukuro"

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.330
I've got to figure out who framed me,
who's behind the scenes!

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:56.500
Makoto, what the hell is going on?

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:01.200
Young people have been
brawling all over Ikebukuro.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:05.200
It's practically civil war
down on Sunshine Street.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:07.830
I want to know what's happening, too.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:11.200
If I don't hurry and do something,
Ikebukuro will be a mess!

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.250
Leave that to the police.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:16.870
Just turn yourself in. You won't regret it.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:20.080
Do you know how Takashi and my mom are doing?

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:24.910
I heard from the hospital.
They're both still unconscious.

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:27.830
But they are still alive.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:31.450
That's all I needed to hear. Thanks, Big Rei.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.580
Wait, Makoto. Hear me out.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:39.000
Sorry, I'm doing this my way. See you.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:41.120
Makoto! Makoto!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.250
Contact Detective Yoshioka.

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:48.540
He should know where
Makoto is likely to turn up.

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.870
--Yes, sir.
--Yes, sir.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:54.040
Makoto...

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:29.410
That's our Kyouichi!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.290
"A death reported in the dispute..."
"Gang violence"

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.290
Right now in Ikebukuro, a dispute
has broken out between two groups.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:35.500
Right now in Ikebukuro, a dispute
has broken out between two groups.

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:41.200
The details are unclear, but it appears
to be a turf war between gangs.

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.450
Their respective team colors are blue and red,

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:49.200
and ordinary citizens dressed in
blue or red are being harmed as well,

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.750
so the police are advising caution.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:02.660
"beef bowl" "curry"

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:25.700
It's coming from Kobe. That's all I can tell.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:28.500
Kobe?! Not Ikebukuro?

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:32.910
Chances are, the photographer
forwarded the image to Kobe,

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:36.040
then had a cohort there upload it.

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.000
The guy's cautious.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:43.290
So, you can't tell who took the photo, either?

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.580
Not possible.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.830
There is a clue, though.

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:51.160
Your smartphone.

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:57.160
You said pursuers were waiting
for you everywhere you went.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:01.330
In other words, whoever framed you
knew what you were doing,

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:05.290
and they were feeding that info to the G-Boys.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:10.330
You were wise to turn off your
smartphone before calling the police.

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.750
They'd have traced your location.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:19.120
However, it's possible to locate
a smartphone even if you're not the police.

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.540
There it is.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:24.290
What's this?

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:29.700
It's a spy app for transmitting
location info, calls, correspondence,

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:34.540
and search history to another terminal
without the phone's owner noticing.

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:37.410
They're often used to investigate infidelity.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:42.200
Someone installed this
and has been tracking your actions.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:46.660
And it's a nasty type--not easy to remove.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:49.450
Makoto Majima.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:55.410
As a witness to the shooting of Takashi Andou,
I ask that you come with me.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:57.660
Down to the Ikebukuro Police Station.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.950
It's quite the uproar.

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:18.410
Somebody set me up.

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:23.660
It's probably whoever made Mitsuki
shoot Takashi and took that picture.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:27.540
Mitsuki Fujimoto is apparently missing.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:30.330
Even his buddies can't contact him.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:33.830
But they say he probably got scared
by the dispute, and ran off.

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:38.120
Drop me off.

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:39.200
What?

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.450
Mitsuki's in danger.

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:43.450
No, they might have already offed him.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:45.950
He's the one who actually
shot Takashi, after all.

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:51.620
It's not just Mitsuki. At this rate,
there's no telling how many kids will die!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.830
I'm the only one who can stop it.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.830
Let me go. Please!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:16.500
This is voluntary, not compulsory.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.790
You're free to get out.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:23.910
But if you come to the police,
you'll be safe for now.

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:26.040
Come with me, Makoto.

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:38.330
Don't do anything that would
make your mother cry.

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:20.000
<i>What's up</i>

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:23.120
<i>A world where guys with plans</i>
<i>are the first to fade away</i>

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:25.830
<i>The thought hit me after being out all night</i>

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:28.660
<i>A gulf forms with the respectable types</i>

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:31.790
<i>The MIC you nervously gripped</i>

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:34.410
<i>Leave it behind on the stage</i>

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:37.500
<i>Unable to trust in the next move</i>

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:40.450
<i>You get down off the stage of dreams</i>

00:22:40.450 --> 00:22:43.250
<i>Fade away from the bustle of the scene</i>

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:46.160
<i>Do you know what becomes of him after that?</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:49.290
<i>In fact, are you even prepared to know?</i>

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:52.040
<i>Now that we're involved,</i>
<i>I want to watch you take off</i>

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:54.790
<i>From the runway you chose</i>

00:22:54.790 --> 00:22:58.790
<i>If we happen to meet again today or tomorrow</i>

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:02.450
<i>Somewhere on this Earth</i>

00:23:02.450 --> 00:23:03.910
<i>Let's have fun freestyling</i>

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:07.000
<i>Like we did that time</i>

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:09.660
<i>What's up</i>

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:11.160
<i>After the live show</i>

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:12.660
<i>In a train window</i>

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:14.040
<i>A brother's face, I find</i>

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:15.540
<i>Comes suddenly to mind</i>

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:18.540
<i>Right now, I don't feel like</i>
<i>lookin' back on the past</i>

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:21.410
<i>But no way in hell am I forgettin' it</i>

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:22.870
<i>After the live show</i>

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:24.370
<i>In a train window</i>

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:25.790
<i>A brother's face, I find</i>

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:27.250
<i>Comes suddenly to mind</i>

